      "text": "Starlink brings high-speed internet to more schools in Lesotho’s mountains.\n\nComputers delivered to Marakabei High School in 2017 finally went online with Starlink. The project is expanding to Thaba-Tseka Technical Institute with support from the U.S. Embassy in Maseru. ♥️",
